la.org/en-US/firefox/user/18443105/"},"developers":[],"screenshots":[{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/300/300880.png?modified=1787990657","width":1920,"height":1080,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/300/300880.jpg?modified=1787990657","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":300}],"contributionURL":"https://ko-fi.com/baylor?utm_content=product-page-contribute&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=addons.mozilla.org","averageRating":4.561,"reviewCount":21,"reviewURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/udm-14/reviews/","updateDate":1794616278000},{"id":"{7fcfc4a5-e918-4286-b0a8-d7564a68719c}","icons":{"32":"https://addons.mozilla.org/static-server/img/addon-icons/default-32.png","64":"https://addons.mozilla.org/static-server/img/addon-icons/default-64.png","128":"https://addons.mozilla.org/static-server/img/addon-icons/default-128.png"},"name":"[Blur][White] LightOrange & Cyan","version":"1.2","sourceURI":"https://addons.mozilla.org/firefox/downloads/file/4860420/blur_white_lightorange_cyan-1.2.xpi","homepageURL":null,"supportURL":null,"amoListingURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/blur-white-lightorange-cyan/","description":"Light Orange and Cyan\nHit ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ to supports me.","fullDescription":"Release 1.2: Now supports sidepanels, and has experimental support for vertical tabs!\nRelease 1.1: now it is compatible with larger screens!\n\nDonations are very welcome!\nBitcoin:\nbc1qvhz9h3plvse87wvt09ytmhakkznjpunhff0pa2","weeklyDownloads":60,"type":"theme","creator":{"name":"Docmine17","url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/user/16914358/"},"developers":[],"screenshots":[{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/version-previews/full/4083/4083994.png?modified=1781982344","width":680,"height":92,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/version-previews/thumbs/4083/4083994.png?modified=1781982344","thumbnailWidth":473,"thumbnailHeight":64},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/version-previews/full/4083/4083995.svg?modified=1781982345","width":720,"height":92,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/version-previews/thumbs/4083/4083995.jpg?modified=1781982345","thumbnailWidth":720,"thumbnailHeight":92}],"contributionURL":"","averageRating":4.6667,"reviewCount":11,"reviewURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/blur-white-lightorange-cyan/reviews/","updateDate":1781996584000},{"id":"jid1-MnnxcxisBPnSXQ@jetpack","icons":{"32":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/addon_icons/506/506646-32.png?modified=mcrushed","64":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/addon_icons/506/506646-64.png?modified=mcrushed","128":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/addon_icons/506/506646-128.png?modified=mcrushed"},"name":"Privacy Badger","version":"2026.9.15","sourceURI":"https://addons.mozilla.org/firefox/downloads/file/5032646/privacy_badger17-2026.9.15.xpi","homepageURL":"https://privacybadger.org/","supportURL":"https://privacybadger.org/#faq","amoListingURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/privacy-badger17/","description":"You need more than an ad blocker. Stop companies from spying on you with an extension developed by member-supported digital rights nonprofit EFF.","fullDescription":"Privacy Badger automatically learns to block hidden trackers. Whether you want to protect yourself from data brokers or don’t want Big Tech profiting off your browsing, Privacy Badger puts you in control of your data. When you install Privacy Badger, you join a movement of millions taking a stand against online tracking.\n\nPrivacy Badger sends the Global Privacy Control signal to opt you out of data sharing and selling, and the Do Not Track signal to tell companies not to track you. If trackers ignore these signals, Privacy Badger will learn to block them.\n\nBesides automatic tracker blocking, Privacy Badger replaces potentially useful trackers (video players, comments widgets, etc.) with click-to-activate placeholders, and removes outgoing link click tracking on Facebook and Google, with more privacy protections on the way.\n\nTo learn more, see the FAQ on Privacy Badger's homepage.\n\nEFF takes the fight for your privacy beyond the browser to the courts, legislatures, and the streets. Join us.","weeklyDownloads":39090,"type":"extension","creator":{"name":"EFF Technologists","url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/user/5474073/"},"developers":[],"screenshots":[{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/368/368601.png?modified=1783712481","width":1280,"height":800,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/368/368601.jpg?modified=1783712481","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":333},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/368/368602.png?modified=1783712481","width":1280,"height":800,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/368/368602.jpg?modified=1783712481","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":333},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/368/368603.png?modified=1783712481","width":1280,"height":800,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/368/368603.jpg?modified=1783712481","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":333},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/368/368604.png?modified=1783712481","width":1280,"height":800,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/368/368604.jpg?modified=1783712481","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":333},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/368/368605.png?modified=1783712481","width":1280,"height":800,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/368/368605.jpg?modified=1783712481","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":333},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/368/368606.png?modified=1783712481","width":1280,"height":800,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/368/368606.jpg?modified=1783712481","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":333}],"contributionURL":"https://paypal.me/SupportEFF?utm_content=product-page-contribute&utm_medium=referral&utm_source=addons.mozilla.org","averageRating":4.8126,"reviewCount":629,"reviewURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/privacy-badger17/reviews/","updateDate":1789500967000},{"id":"uBlock0@raymondhill.net","icons":{"32":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/addon_icons/607/607454-32.png?modified=mcrushed","64":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/addon_icons/607/607454-64.png?modified=mcrushed","128":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/addon_icons/607/607454-128.png?modified=mcrushed"},"name":"uBlock Origin","version":"1.76.4","sourceURI":"https://addons.mozilla.org/firefox/downloads/file/5257481/ublock_origin-1.76.4.xpi","homepageURL":"https://github.com/gorhill/uBlock#ublock-origin","supportURL":"https://old.reddit.com/r/uBlockOrigin/","amoListingURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/ublock-origin/","description":"Finally, an efficient wide-spectrum content blocker. Easy on CPU and memory.","fullDescription":"uBlock Origin is not an \"ad blocker\", it's a wide-spectrum content blocker with CPU and memory efficiency as a primary feature.\n\n\n\nOut of the box, uBO blocks ads, trackers, coin miners, popups, etc. through the following lists of filters, enabled by default:\n\n    EasyList (ads)\n    EasyPrivacy (tracking)\n    Peter Lowe’s Ad server list (ads and tracking)\n    Online Malicious URL Blocklist\n    uBO's own lists\n\n\nMore lists are available for you to select if you wish:\n\n    EasyList Cookie\n    Fanboy Annoyances\n    AdGuard Annoyances\n    Dan Pollock’s hosts file\n    And many others\n\n\nAdditionally, you can point-and-click to block JavaScript locally or globally, create your own global or local rules to override entries from filter lists, and many more advanced features.\n\n\n\nFree.\nOpen source with public license (GPLv3)\nFor users by users.\n\nIf ever you really do want to contribute something, think about the people working hard to maintain the filter lists you are using, which were made available to use by all for free.\n\n\n    Documentation\n    Release notes\n    Community support @ Reddit\n    Contributors @ GitHub\n    Contributors @ Crowdin","weeklyDownloads":235510,"type":"extension","creator":{"name":"Raymond Hill","url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/user/11423598/"},"developers":[],"screenshots":[{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/238/238546.png?modified=1622132421","width":1011,"height":758,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/238/238546.jpg?modified=1622132421","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":400,"caption":"The popup panel: default mode"},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/238/238548.png?modified=1622132423","width":1011,"height":758,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/238/238548.jpg?modified=1622132423","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":400,"caption":"The dashboard: stock filter lists"},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/238/238547.png?modified=1622132425","width":1011,"height":758,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/238/238547.jpg?modified=1622132425","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":400,"caption":"The popup panel: default-deny mode"},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/238/238549.png?modified=1622132426","width":1011,"height":758,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/238/238549.jpg?modified=1622132426","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":400,"caption":"The dashboard: settings"},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/238/238552.png?modified=1622132430","width":970,"height":1800,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/238/238552.jpg?modified=1622132430","thumbnailWidth":216,"thumbnailHeight":400,"caption":"The popup panel in Firefox Preview: default mode with more blocking options revealed"},{"url":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/full/230/230370.png?modified=1622132432","width":800,"height":600,"thumbnailURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/user-media/previews/thumbs/230/230370.jpg?modified=1622132432","thumbnailWidth":533,"thumbnailHeight":400,"caption":"The unified logger tells you all that uBO is seeing and doing"}],"contributionURL":"","averageRating":4.8023,"reviewCount":5908,"reviewURL":"https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/ublock-origin/reviews/","updateDate":1794763894000}]}